# Returns the raw index LINE for pName, or the empty string when the vault
# holds no index or no entry for that name.
#
# RAW on purpose: the values are still escaped. Only the caller knows which
# fields it wants, and $indexClean is the one thing to mirror when it does.
#
# The leading kCr is the same trick $indexPut uses: it makes every line
# start after one, so class=Tool can never be matched inside a value.

If isclear(pVaultRef)
	Quit method ''
End If
Set reference idxRef to pVaultRef.$classes.$findname('execVaultIndex')
If isclear(idxRef)
	Quit method ''
End If
Calculate text as con(kCr,idxRef.$userinfo)
Calculate text2 as con(kCr,'class=',pName,kTab)
Calculate n as pos(text2,text)
If n=0
	Quit method ''
End If
Calculate text as mid(text,n+1,len(text)-n)
Calculate n as pos(kCr,text)
If n>0
	Calculate text as mid(text,1,n-1)
End If
Quit method text